<title>INDIA: India 96/97 rubber output seen at 542,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 rubber output seen at 542,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's rubber output in 1996/97 (July-June) is expected to be 542,000 tonnes compared with 507,000 tonnes in the same period in 1995/96, the government said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The government said in its annual Economic Survey that said rubber consumption in 1996/97 was likely to be 556,000 tonnes compared with 526,000 tonnes in 1995/96.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
